From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khem Raj <khem.raj@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:07:50 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] test: Build tipc_test_suite only when struct tipcc_addr is
 available

tipc_test_suite uses struct tipcc_addr and TIPCC_ADDR, which only exist
in a linux/tipc.h carrying the out-of-tree TIPC "tipcc" address API.
Mainline kernel headers do not have them, so the build fails with:

  tipc_test.h:69:21: error: field has incomplete type 'struct tipcc_addr'

libtipc and the tipcc_hello_world demo already guard their use with
'#ifdef TIPCC_ADDR'. Check for it in configure and skip the test suite
when it is missing.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [tipc-discussion@lists.sourceforge.net, <20261125080050.2410104-1-raj.khem@gmail.com>]
AI-Generated: Uses Claude Code
Signed-off-by: Khem Raj <khem.raj@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 configure.ac     | 4 ++++
 test/Makefile.am | 6 +++++-
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index 83e0ea5..d7a1558 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -32,6 +32,10 @@ LDFLAGS="$LDFLAGS ../../libtipc/libtipc.a -lpthread"
 AC_CHECK_TYPE(struct tipc_sioc_ln_req, [tipc_lss=yes],[], [[#include <linux/tipc.h>]])
 AM_CONDITIONAL(TIPC_LINK_STATE_SUBSCRITION, test "x$tipc_lss" = "xyes")
 
+# tipc_test_suite needs struct tipcc_addr, which mainline linux/tipc.h lacks
+AC_CHECK_DECL(TIPCC_ADDR, [tipcc_addr=yes], [], [[#include <linux/tipc.h>]])
+AM_CONDITIONAL(TIPCC_ADDR, test "x$tipcc_addr" = "xyes")
+
 # Checks for TIPC GO API
 AC_ARG_WITH(goapi,AS_HELP_STRING([--with-goapi],[Compile TIPC GO APIs examples]),[goapi=true],[])
 if test "x$goapi" == "xtrue"; then
diff --git a/test/Makefile.am b/test/Makefile.am
index b45dfd2..edda891 100644
--- a/test/Makefile.am
+++ b/test/Makefile.am
@@ -1 +1,5 @@
-SUBDIRS = group_test ptts multicast_blast overlapping_ranges iovec topsrv_stress rdm tipc_test_suite
+SUBDIRS = group_test ptts multicast_blast overlapping_ranges iovec topsrv_stress rdm
+
+if TIPCC_ADDR
+SUBDIRS += tipc_test_suite
+endif
